-- WO-172 test fixtures: portal service history API.
--
-- Seeded entities:
--   - 64 Acme work orders across two Acme sites (WO172-A-* and WO172-B-*)
--   - 8 Bluestone work orders (to test cross-account isolation)
--   - Deliberate duplicate created_at timestamps to verify UUID tie-break ordering
--   - Mix of all lifecycle states (NEW, ASSIGNED, EN_ROUTE, IN_PROGRESS, ON_HOLD,
--     COMPLETED, CLOSED, CANCELLED)
--
-- UUID namespacing:
--   Work orders: 00000000-0000-7172-8000-XXXXXXXXXXXX  (Acme + Bluestone)
--   Acme site 1: 00000000-0000-7013-8000-000000000001  (from seed-core.sql)
--   Acme site 2: 00000000-0000-7013-8000-000000000002  (from seed-core.sql)
--   Blue site:   00000000-0000-7013-8000-000000000005  (from seed-core.sql)
--   Acme cust:   00000000-0000-7012-8000-000000000001
